{"data":{"uuid":"1f6908a2-80b0-48c1-ad76-d93a6afcbfd7","slug":"spectre","name":"Spectre","class_name":"QDRV_RACO_S01_Spectre_SCItem","classification":"Ship.QuantumDrive","classification_label":"Quantum Drive","description":{"en_EN":"The Spectre can't make your ship invisible, but it comes close. Expertly crafted by RAMP, this quantum drive disperses heat and hides IR and EM signatures to make it a great small component for those that want to go unnoticed.","de_DE":"Hersteller: RAMP Corporation\nTyp (En): Quantum Drive\nTyp (De): Quantenantrieb\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S1\nG\u00fctegrad: A\nKlasse: Stealth (Tarnung)\n\nDer Spectre kann dein Schiff nicht unsichtbar machen, kommt dem aber nahe. Von RAMP meisterhaft gefertigt, verteilt dieser Quantenantrieb die W\u00e4rme und verbirgt IR- und EM-Signaturen, um ihn zu einer gro\u00dfartigen kleinen Komponente f\u00fcr diejenigen zu machen, die unbemerkt bleiben wollen.","zh_CN":"\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1aRAMP\u516c\u53f8\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a1 \n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aA\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u9690\u5f62\n\n\u5e7d\u9b42\u4e0d\u80fd\u4f7f\u60a8\u7684\u98de\u8239\u6d88\u5931\uff0c\u4f46\u5b83\u5feb\u8981\u6d88\u5931\u4e86\u3002\u8be5\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\u7531RAMP\u7cbe\u5fc3\u5236\u4f5c\uff0c\u53ef\u4ee5\u6563\u53d1\u70ed\u91cf\u5e76\u9690\u85cf\u7ea2\u5916\u548c\u7535\u78c1\u4fe1\u53f7\uff0c\u5bf9\u4e8e\u60f3\u8981\u5b58\u4f4e\u8c03\u7684\u4eba\u6765\u8bf4\u662f\u5f88\u68d2\u7684\u5c0f\u7ec4\u4ef6\u3002","fr_FR":"Type d'article : Propulseur quantique\nFabricant : RAMP Corporation\nTaille : 1\nQualit\u00e9 : A\nClasse : Furtif\n\nLe Spectre ne peut pas rendre votre vaisseau invisible, mais il s'en approche. Con\u00e7u avec soin par RAMP, ce propulseur quantique disperse la chaleur et masque les signatures IR et EM, ce qui en fait un excellent petit composant pour ceux qui veulent passer inaper\u00e7us."},"size":1,"mass":89,"event_source":[],"is_base_variant":true,"is_c